message: "If you use Aisha AI, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Aisha AI — Open-Source AI Voice Assistant for Windows"
abstract: >-
  Aisha AI is a free, open-source, Jarvis-style autonomous AI voice assistant
  and desktop agent for Windows. It features a lip-syncing Live2D anime avatar,
  screen vision, multi-step PC automation (apps, files, browser, WhatsApp,
  email), document and presentation creation, web research, and multi-model LLM
  routing. It speaks natural Hindi and English.
type: software
